        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;Idle warning, renewal and absolute lifetime are distinct. An expired session cannot be renewed as an active one.&#10;Logout confirmation cancellation preserves the session; confirmed logout revokes its access.&#10;The diagram shows operator session controls. Customer token-based logout also ends the current device session." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
